Restore the pre-Web-sync interaction contract for native browser controls and
Valdi onTouch views. Layout containers are pointer-transparent, so text fields,
scroll views, and onTouch views must explicitly opt back into hit testing.
onTouch also needs the desktop mouse sequence used by Widgets' Slider, with
coordinates local to the target view.
